// EntityOVN A token associated with a particular UTM Entity+version created by the DSS upon creation or modification of an Entity reference and provided to the client creating or modifying the Entity reference.  The EntityOVN is stored privately by the DSS and then compared against entries in a Key provided to mutate the airspace.  The EntityOVN is also provided by the client whenever that client transmits the full information of the Entity (either via GET, or via a subscription notification).
